q('Ben intensely fears flying and has avoided all flights for 8 months, functioning well otherwise. Best diagnosis:','Specific phobia','Agoraphobia','Panic disorder','Social anxiety disorder','Fear of a specific object or situation, lasting typically 6+ months.'),
q('Fear of scrutiny in social or performance situations, with avoidance, best describes:','Social anxiety disorder','Specific phobia','Agoraphobia','Avoidant PD only','Social anxiety centers on fear of negative evaluation.'),
q('A patient suddenly cannot move her arm; neurological examination finds no cause, and symptoms are inconsistent with known disease. Best fit:','Functional neurological symptom disorder (conversion)','Malingering','Somatic symptom disorder only','Factitious disorder imposed on another','Altered voluntary motor or sensory function incompatible with neurological disease.'),
q('Two or more distinct personality states with gaps in recall for everyday events best describe:','Dissociative identity disorder','Depersonalization disorder','Schizophrenia','Borderline PD','DID features identity disruption and amnesia gaps.'),
q('A pervasive pattern of unstable relationships, self-image, and affect with marked impulsivity best fits:','Borderline personality disorder','Histrionic PD','Narcissistic PD','Bipolar II','Fear of abandonment and unstable identity are hallmark features.')
